WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.784 --> 00:00:02.619
- What is yoga?

00:00:02.619 --> 00:00:03.829
Oh...

00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:06.582
(sitar music)

00:00:06.582 --> 00:00:09.833
- Obviously everyone knows
yoga comes from India, duh.

00:00:11.063 --> 00:00:14.464
- For me, yoga is as appealing
as watching paint dry.

00:00:14.464 --> 00:00:16.027
- Yeah, I can name a few yoga positions.

00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:17.762
There's like, the downward dog.

00:00:17.762 --> 00:00:19.636
- I know a bit about yoga,

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:21.655
I'm just a lazy sack of
shit so I don't do it.

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:26.183
(sitar and drum music)

00:00:27.995 --> 00:00:29.938
- [Instructor] There are so many different

00:00:29.938 --> 00:00:31.734
definitions of what yoga is.

00:00:31.734 --> 00:00:36.612
Traditionally speaking,
yoga is sanskrit for "yoke,"

00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:38.781
which is also translated to "union."

00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:44.530
Inhale, exhale.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:48.141
Inhale, exhale.

00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:50.959
And that's what it's gonna look like

00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:54.338
when you traditionally understand what the

00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:56.465
sun salutation is.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:00:59.928
Inhale, hands up to the sky,

00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:04.928
and exhale, and we are
going to bend at our waist.

00:01:05.249 --> 00:01:10.241
(sitar music)

00:01:20.582 --> 00:01:23.950
- Like I feel like the
first step into an exorcism.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.932
- Am I gonna be in pain tomorrow?

00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:26.578
I feel like I'm gonna be in pain.

00:01:26.578 --> 00:01:28.371
I feel like I'm just
gonna be in constant pain

00:01:28.371 --> 00:01:29.790
for the next two months.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:33.127
My back hurts, so much.

00:01:33.127 --> 00:01:34.366
Like so much.

00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:39.262
(sitar music)

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.094
- How long have we been doing this?

00:01:43.094 --> 00:01:44.515
Two weeks?

00:01:44.515 --> 00:01:46.014
Feels like forever.

00:01:46.014 --> 00:01:47.349
- Yoga's actually kind of fun.

00:01:47.349 --> 00:01:49.309
And I think that's partly
because we're in these classes

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.520
with a bunch of our colleagues
that we know and like.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.606
- The thing that caught me
off-guard the most about yoga

00:01:53.606 --> 00:01:57.070
was the rage I was
experiencing the first week.

00:01:57.070 --> 00:02:00.529
And my body's total
rejection of the practice.

00:02:00.529 --> 00:02:03.163
So I was doing a good
job not feeling that rage

00:02:03.163 --> 00:02:05.284
that I was feeling a lot in the beginning,

00:02:05.284 --> 00:02:07.994
but now today it came back in full force,

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.579
and I was swearing.

00:02:09.579 --> 00:02:11.790
- The most challenging pose is anything

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.459
where I have to go across my body.

00:02:14.459 --> 00:02:16.044
Cause, to be honest,

00:02:16.044 --> 00:02:18.839
yoga with big boobs is a
little more challenging.

00:02:18.839 --> 00:02:21.591
- I think I feel better so far.

00:02:21.591 --> 00:02:24.721
Like, my body isn't totally
rebelling against me

00:02:24.721 --> 00:02:27.349
at all hours of the
day, which is a change.

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:28.849
- Two weeks in and I
don't think there's been

00:02:28.849 --> 00:02:31.651
that much of a change in my body.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:35.106
- [Instructor] I think
people get discouraged really

00:02:35.106 --> 00:02:36.815
easily when they begin.

00:02:36.815 --> 00:02:38.567
You have to want to do
it, you have to really

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:42.071
want to learn, you have to
really have an open mind.

00:02:42.071 --> 00:02:44.909
And if you've never done
yoga, you don't really have

00:02:44.909 --> 00:02:46.408
that opened mind yet.

00:02:46.408 --> 00:02:48.244
So you need to begin to develop it.

00:02:50.122 --> 00:02:52.247
- I feel alright.

00:02:52.247 --> 00:02:53.540
- Yoga's fine.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:57.794
- Yoga feels like a drag before it starts,

00:02:57.794 --> 00:02:59.255
and then after it's done I'm like

00:02:59.255 --> 00:03:00.130
"oh, that was pretty good."

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.632
- We're half way through, I feel great.

00:03:02.632 --> 00:03:04.095
I've only been doing this for a month

00:03:04.095 --> 00:03:06.345
and I can already see the changes.

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:08.349
I'm getting better, I'm
getting more flexible,

00:03:08.349 --> 00:03:10.682
I'm getting stronger, I can see it.

00:03:10.682 --> 00:03:12.471
The results are real.

00:03:12.471 --> 00:03:16.770
- [Instructor] Down,
inhale, upward facing dog.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:17.888
Exhale, downward facing dog.

00:03:17.888 --> 00:03:19.318
- Henry hates the chanting,

00:03:19.318 --> 00:03:21.276
but I really like the chanting in yoga.

00:03:21.276 --> 00:03:23.779
- Chanting is uh, it's something we do.

00:03:23.779 --> 00:03:26.717
- I am not connected with the chanting.

00:03:26.717 --> 00:03:29.451
I'm not connecting to
the spirituality of it

00:03:29.451 --> 00:03:30.911
in a lot of ways.

00:03:30.911 --> 00:03:33.915
- I can't help but have a
really stupid grin on my face.

00:03:33.915 --> 00:03:36.207
You close your eyes but
I'm smiling the whole time.

00:03:36.207 --> 00:03:38.710
We go "om..." I don't know the words.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.964
- It's just not really my thing.

00:03:40.964 --> 00:03:42.827
I like that I'm doing this.

00:03:42.827 --> 00:03:44.052
- [Instructor] T Lo, bring your arms

00:03:44.052 --> 00:03:46.968
a little closer together.

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:50.139
- If I were to go somewhere by myself,

00:03:50.139 --> 00:03:52.766
I don't think I would feel
comfortable doing that.

00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:55.894
- Oh my favorite posture, um...

00:03:55.894 --> 00:04:00.894
(sitar music)

00:04:08.073 --> 00:04:10.534
- Can I just lay down on my back?

00:04:10.534 --> 00:04:11.701
(laughs)

00:04:11.701 --> 00:04:14.705
- Now when we started
this, I was like here.

00:04:14.705 --> 00:04:17.655
And like I was burning, now...

00:04:17.655 --> 00:04:19.835
- I don't know, it just
feels like a good stretch.

00:04:19.835 --> 00:04:21.212
I'm not gonna answer questions
while I do it though.

00:04:21.212 --> 00:04:23.262
(laughs) It's bullshit.

00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:24.663
- So I decided it was time to go

00:04:24.663 --> 00:04:25.508
to the chiropractor.

00:04:25.508 --> 00:04:29.720
We took an x-ray, turns out,
I have fucking scoliosis.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.566
Look at this, that's my spine.

00:04:31.566 --> 00:04:34.101
Right there, that's like,
where all my pain is.

00:04:34.101 --> 00:04:35.934
In a weird way I'm like
really relieved to know

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:38.426
that I'm not crazy, and
like I actually have a thing

00:04:38.426 --> 00:04:40.480
that we now know and I can fix.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.567
And like I asked him, "what should I do?"

00:04:42.567 --> 00:04:44.245
he said "yoga."

00:04:45.861 --> 00:04:47.613
- [T Lo] I'm glad I'm doing these classes,

00:04:47.613 --> 00:04:50.657
because I would have
never taken it upon myself

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:53.118
to go to yoga classes.

00:04:53.118 --> 00:04:58.118
Starting out in this
environment with my coworkers

00:04:58.207 --> 00:05:00.583
is probably the best way to go,

00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:02.878
because we're all just having fun

00:05:02.878 --> 00:05:04.672
and joking with each other.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.009
- I didn't know we were doing that.

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:10.552
- Uh, God.

00:05:10.552 --> 00:05:12.303
- That terrifies me.

00:05:12.303 --> 00:05:16.016
- I'm walking down to
my first non-Buzzfeed

00:05:16.016 --> 00:05:17.806
yoga class in my life.

00:05:17.806 --> 00:05:20.939
- I'm about to take a class on my own.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:24.482
- That's the sweatiest I've been in years.

00:05:24.482 --> 00:05:26.610
- We did shit I've never done before.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.267
- I was probably not
the worst person there,

00:05:28.267 --> 00:05:30.697
but I was definitely bottom five.

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:34.367
- There's no way I
would ever pay for yoga.

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:38.163
- There's definitely no
laughing, it's not a fun class.

00:05:38.163 --> 00:05:40.332
- There was this guy with
a man bun next to me,

00:05:40.332 --> 00:05:42.477
he seemed to know
exactly what he was doing

00:05:42.477 --> 00:05:44.335
I did not like being next to him at all.

00:05:44.335 --> 00:05:46.004
- It's like a reminder that, oh yeah,

00:05:46.004 --> 00:05:48.423
just doing two months of yoga is like,

00:05:48.423 --> 00:05:50.426
a drop in a bucket of
what it takes to actually

00:05:50.426 --> 00:05:51.260
be good at yoga.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.802
- I'm ready to keep doing this,

00:05:52.802 --> 00:05:56.849
and be come a full-blown yogi.

00:05:56.849 --> 00:06:00.018
I don't like saying that, it sounds gross.

00:06:00.018 --> 00:06:01.853
- [Instructor] That's a
really relative question.

00:06:01.853 --> 00:06:04.547
Like I still don't feel
lie I have a fully grounded

00:06:04.547 --> 00:06:08.569
yoga practice, and I've
been 10 years plus in.

00:06:08.569 --> 00:06:12.655
Now for other people it could take months.

00:06:12.655 --> 00:06:15.784
(cheering)

00:06:15.784 --> 00:06:18.578
- I already kind of miss doing yoga.

00:06:18.578 --> 00:06:20.538
I don't know how much
you captured on film,

00:06:20.538 --> 00:06:23.374
but it was such a fun atmosphere

00:06:23.374 --> 00:06:24.793
for any kind of work out class.

00:06:24.793 --> 00:06:26.544
There was lots of laughing, lots of jokes,

00:06:26.544 --> 00:06:28.004
lots of give and take.

00:06:28.004 --> 00:06:28.922
- Here's the thing,

00:06:28.922 --> 00:06:31.049
I thought yoga was
something a little different

00:06:31.049 --> 00:06:32.551
than yoga turns out to be.

00:06:32.551 --> 00:06:35.220
- I think the biggest
misconception of yoga

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.597
is that it's easy.

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:41.460
- I think yoga's helped
me address the things

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.393
I'm unhappy about.

00:06:42.393 --> 00:06:46.731
- I don't do physical activity
unless I have to do it.

00:06:46.731 --> 00:06:48.983
Yoga is definitely a physical activity.

00:06:48.983 --> 00:06:50.276
- I've been in pain and I was like

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:51.695
"Ah, I'm just out of shape, ha."

00:06:51.695 --> 00:06:54.607
But no, I have a fucking curve in my back.

00:06:54.607 --> 00:06:56.741
Look at that, I'm pointing to the graphic

00:06:56.741 --> 00:06:57.951
I assume you're gonna put in.

00:06:57.951 --> 00:06:58.952
(clap)

00:06:58.952 --> 00:07:00.339
- Fucking earned this shavasana.

00:07:00.339 --> 00:07:03.290
- Oh God.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.613
Best pose.

00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:12.125
(chanting)

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.344
- As soon as it gets easy,

00:07:16.344 --> 00:07:18.888
you have to push yourself
to make it hard again.

00:07:18.888 --> 00:07:21.768
And that's um..

00:07:21.768 --> 00:07:23.872
I don't know, kind of dumb.

